@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Why Oxygen Solutions?";
}

<div class="os-page-header">
    <div class="os-section-eyebrow">01 &mdash; Why us</div>
    <h1 class="font-serif">Why Choose Oxygen Solutions?</h1>
    <p class="os-page-subhead">Quality equipment. A dealer-focused approach. Simplified ordering from product selection to delivery.</p>
</div>

<section class="why-intro">
    <p>When it comes to oxygen and respiratory equipment, having access to the right products is only part of the solution. You also need a dependable partner who understands your needs, provides quality equipment, and helps make the process simple from product selection to delivery.</p>
    <p>At Oxygen Solutions, we are committed to connecting dealers and customers with dependable oxygen-related products from trusted manufacturers. Our goal is to make sourcing respiratory and oxygen equipment easier, more efficient, and more reliable.</p>
</section>

<section class="why-pillars">
    <div class="why-pillar">
        <div class="why-pillar-num font-mono">01</div>
        <div class="why-pillar-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">Quality Products from Trusted Manufacturers</h2>
            <p>We work with established manufacturers to provide access to a range of oxygen and respiratory products. By working directly within the manufacturer and dealer network, we help make quality products available through a streamlined distribution process.</p>
            <p>Our product portfolio is selected with reliability, performance, and practical application in mind.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-pillar">
        <div class="why-pillar-num font-mono">02</div>
        <div class="why-pillar-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">A Dealer-Focused Approach</h2>
            <p>Our dealers are an important part of everything we do. We understand that every dealer has different requirements, customers, locations, and operational needs.</p>
            <p>Oxygen Solutions provides dealers with a dedicated online portal where they can access product information, dealer pricing, place purchase orders, review invoices, track payment status, and access important documentation. This gives our dealer partners greater visibility and control over their business transactions.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-pillar">
        <div class="why-pillar-num font-mono">03</div>
        <div class="why-pillar-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">Simplified Ordering</h2>
            <p>We believe ordering should be straightforward. Our dealer portal allows approved dealers to submit purchase orders online and track their orders through a centralized platform. Once an order is reviewed and approved, the appropriate invoicing and fulfillment processes can be initiated efficiently.</p>
            <p>By bringing these processes together, we help reduce unnecessary paperwork and improve communication between dealers, Oxygen Solutions, and manufacturers.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-pillar">
        <div class="why-pillar-num font-mono">04</div>
        <div class="why-pillar-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">Reliable Business Support</h2>
            <p>Distribution is more than simply moving products from one location to another. It is about creating a dependable connection between manufacturers and dealers.</p>
            <p>Our team works to provide responsive communication, accurate product information, and organized order and documentation management so our dealer partners can focus on serving their customers.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-pillar">
        <div class="why-pillar-num font-mono">05</div>
        <div class="why-pillar-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">Transparency and Organization</h2>
            <p>With centralized access to purchase orders, invoices, payment information, and supporting documents, dealers can have a clearer view of their transactions with Oxygen Solutions.</p>
            <p>Our digital platform is designed to make important information easier to access when it is needed.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="why-pillar">
        <div class="why-pillar-num font-mono">06</div>
        <div class="why-pillar-body">
            <h2 class="font-serif">A Partner You Can Rely On</h2>
            <p>At Oxygen Solutions, our focus is simple: provide dependable products, simplify distribution, and support our dealer network.</p>
            <p>We are committed to building long-term relationships with our dealers and manufacturer partners through reliability, transparency, and responsive service.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="why-cta">
    <div class="why-cta-inner">
        <h2 class="font-serif">Ready to get started?</h2>
        <p>Explore our products or contact us today to learn how Oxygen Solutions can support your business.</p>
        <div class="why-cta-actions">
            <a asp-controller="Catalog" asp-action="Index" class="btn-solid">Browse equipment</a>
            <a asp-controller="Contact" asp-action="Index" class="btn-outline">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
